WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
In Catalog, choose Add Catalog Item.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.083
Choose 3D Printing for a planter you print yourself.

00:06.083 --> 00:11.167
The chooser fills in how you obtain it and the item type. Keep both defaults for this planter.

00:11.167 --> 00:15.833
Only two entries remain. Type an item name, then enter your selling price.

00:15.833 --> 00:21.833
Fourteen dollars is our manual price. Leave costing, inventory, and additional details closed.

00:21.833 --> 00:25.833
Choose Save Item. Your planter appears in this workspace’s Catalog.

